      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然还是比赛最棒。\n大拓太阳神的哭哭也飞走了，\n正打算去向第一红宝石道歉时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb8198938b46447e91f76d507207b3adfa7682b0ca4216d30fff4ced48d713d",
