      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "反而是对方先道歉，还被称赞了跑法。\n如果就这样越变越强的话，\n会不会就这样成为好姐妹呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97443ab7d19ae4c0c59535c4ee7293e7abab4bdcb2459e09a665e2bddd922f2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
