      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大拓太阳神充满干劲。\n决定下个目标是“英里冠军赛”！\n前往挑战在短距离超强的青竹回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74088eaed396dd2535170b651ad9ca3c67cc0cde224d85e069f4d3bc6930186",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
